nty"],["ARC or PLC in Lonoke County","/arc-plc/arkansas/lonoke-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 65% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 35%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 60% and February to March at 56% on the middle. Grid 17552 had its driest year in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
